00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:42.662 line:92%
-He was -- So, he was a judge --

00:07:42.662 --> 00:07:43.496 size:75% position:38% line:92%
He was a guest judge

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the Boston Comedy Festival.
-Okay.

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:48.301
-And then, he would, like,
deejay the after-parties,

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I think was, like,
a part of his deal.

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:54.040
I think he was like, "I won'
judge unless you let me deejay."

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:54.941 line:92%
And he was a pretty dope -

00:07:54.941 --> 00:07:56.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
All he played was,
