00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:58.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, Southern,
like, Atlanta music

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:01.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, like, Lil Jon and stuff
which was really awesome.

00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:03.015
It was a great time.
I was very shocked by all of it.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:05.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was shocked he was there
I was shocked he was a deejay.

00:08:05.852 --> 00:08:07.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was shocked
we looked that much alike.

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:08.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It was all very odd.

00:08:08.688 --> 00:08:10.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That must be jarring,
especially when

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:12.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
