00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:13.626 line:92%
-Yeah, for real, especially --

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:15.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's, like, one of my heroes
as a kid.

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:16.762
Like, who didn't love "Webster"?
-Yeah.

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:19.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
And was he --
How was he as a comedy judge

00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:21.901 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Um, kind.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't think
he really was like --

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:24.337 line:92%
-That's a good thing to hear

